@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
# If APP_API_TOKEN is configured, set the same token here and add the Authorization header
# to protected requests. Do not commit a real token.
@token = replace-with-your-api-token

### Web service health (does not query QuestDB)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health

### API route list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/info
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Check QuestDB connectivity (read-only SELECT 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/questdb/ping
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Registered dataset definitions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/datasets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sample at most 10 rows from the stock basic latest view
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/datasets/stock_basic_latest/sample?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sample at most 10 rows from the stock basic snapshot table
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/datasets/stock_basic_snapshot/sample?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Registered sync job definitions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Write operation: fetch Tushare stock basic and synchronize to QuestDB.
### Run only when you intend to change QuestDB data.
# POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stock-basic/sync
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
